    "setup": "Chuẩn bị vị trí, giữ lưng thẳng, siết chặt cơ lõi và hít thở sâu.",
    "execution": "Grasp an end of a jump rope in each hand and position the rope behind you, touching the floor.\r\n\r\nArc the rope up over your head from behind. Allow your wrists to roll and keep your shoulders loose. \r\n\r\nAs the jump rope arcs towards the floor, jump slightly to allow the jump rope to pass underneath your feet. \r\n\r\nOn the next rotation of the jump rope, cross your arms in front of you just before you jump. Keep your arms crossed for the next rotation.\r\n \r\nUncross your arms before you jump again.\r\n\r\nContinue alternating for the remainder of your set. ",
    "mistakes": "Không giật tạ hoặc dùng quán tính, luôn kiểm soát pha hạ tạ (eccentric) từ 2-3 giây."
