    "setup": "Chuẩn bị vị trí, giữ lưng thẳng, siết chặt cơ lõi và hít thở sâu.",
    "execution": "Step onto the Elliptical machine facing the console. Stand upright on the machine and do not lean forward or backward. Stay balance without leaning the handles for support. Avoid gripping the handles too tightly and look straight ahead.\n\nWhen your left foot goes down, straightening your leg, the right handle should be pulled toward your body. Same for when your right leg goes down. Your arms should be swinging with the handles. \n\nTo turn on the monitor, start pedaling by pushing the pedals in a forward motion with your feet and pushing and pulling on the handles evenly.\n\nKeep the knees slightly bent when straightening the leg on each stroke.\n\nPedaling in a forward motion is recommended because it's easier to balance, it simulates real movements and is not as tough on the knees as backward pedaling.\nYou can increase or decrease the pedaling resistance during your workout by hitting the up and down arrows.\n\nBefore stepping off of the elliptical, make sure that it has fully stopped.\n",
